Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Compare approved design revisions and change rationale to identify functional, interface, and process effects. Separate editorial drawing updates from meaningful changes and preserve requirements that remain binding despite a local modification.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
